# Render fault (selftest: must FAIL): broken-assert aborts on an assert, so
# its render fails — and the gate must report that in the
# `FAIL  <label> (kinematics <part> at <param>=<v>): render failed` shape
# gate-summary.py's "failed before printcheck ran" list collects.
stops stop 0
empty broken-assert
empty-control broken-solid
